度俯视拍摄。她留着银白色齐刘海波波短发，发尾整齐利落，妆容精致，脸颊带有淡粉色腮红，唇色裸粉，佩戴大框黑色方形墨镜遮住双眼，神秘酷飒。身穿黑色露肩紧身连体衣，大U领一字肩设计露出优美锁骨和白皙肩部，短袖贴身勾勒手臂线条，腰部两侧有对称镂空挖剪设计，露出纤细腰窝和侧腰肌肤，下身连体黑色短裤，右侧垂坠不规则飘带增添动感。脖颈佩戴银色细链项链，吊坠为精致十字架造型。右手向前伸展持机自拍，手臂自然入画，左手绕至身后轻扶腰部，身体侧转呈S形曲线，重心偏向一侧，姿态自信张扬。左手提着棕色皮质手提包，包身有黑色装饰条和金属拉链细节。背景是简洁的户外灰色石材地面，规则铺设的花岗岩纹理，无多余杂物。自然散射光均匀柔和，无明显阴影，皮肤白皙通透，整体色调冷峻高级，高清自拍质感，带轻微精致美颜效果，酷飒未来感时尚人像，8K超清细节。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 100, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [20294], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [3731.85302734375, -1114.18408203125], "widgets_values": ["CCD-ZIB-260609-20000.safetensors", 0.8000000000000002], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 20293, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "label": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "lora_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_model"}, "name": "strength_model", "label": "strength_model", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "strength_model"}], "flags": {}, "id": 98, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [20298], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [260, 110], "pos": [4197.1083984375, -1006.3222045898438], "widgets_values": [4], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 20297, "label": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "samples"}, {"widget": {"name": "amount"}, "name": "amount", "label": "amount", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "amount"}], "flags": {}, "id": 101, "type": "RepeatLatentBatch", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.21.0", "ue_properties": {